abstract: >-
  SecureEWS provides auditable post-development stress tests of educational
  early-warning data-minimization claims across review budgets, stages,
  excluded feature blocks, and metrics in OULAD and two UCI datasets.
keywords:
  - learning analytics
  - early-warning systems
  - data minimization
  - workload-constrained evaluation
  - proxy persistence
  - multiplicity
  - temporal validation
